sangati rashi-bandha

  -- rashi-bandha: value-assignment signal for a rashi instance.
  -- appears in the question graph when 'of' connects a named rashi label to its magnitude:
  --   "velocity v1 of 20"  →  [of, rashi-bandha, rashi-bandha]
  --
  -- distinct from shashthi-vibhakti (entity ownership):
  --   shashthi-vibhakti: "ball has mass"   — entity possesses a concept
  --   rashi-bandha:      "v1 of 20"        — rashi label receives its numeric value
  --
  -- consumed by sankhya-bandha: the asprista-sankhya following rashi-bandha
  -- is bound to the preceding mithya label (the rashi instance), not to the satya concept.

  "prashna-sthita"
  "sankhya-sthita"         -- rashi-bandha precedes a sankhya binding
  "sambandha-sthita"       -- it IS a relation — value to instance

shabda rashi-bandha / value-assignment-signal-connecting-rashi-label-to-its-numeric-magnitude

